deployed: 2026-05-12T17:30:00Z · v1.0.85 (Continue as Guest — industry-
standard register / login flow.

USER ASK: "add a continue as guest button that shows the same form
as the whitelist form but with: username, password, email — should
be an industry standard registration and login process."

BOOT SCREEN
  Added "👤 Continue as Guest" button next to "🪙 Connect Wallet".
  Click opens a modal with two tabs:

  SIGN IN tab
    · Username OR email · password · Sign in
  REGISTER tab
    · Username (3–20 chars, /^[a-zA-Z0-9_]+$/)
    · Email (RFC-ish regex /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]{2,}$/)
    · Password (min 8 chars + live strength meter: 4 bars,
      Very weak → Weak → OK → Strong → Very strong)
    · Confirm password (must match)

CRYPTO
  Salted SHA-256 — every new user gets 16 random bytes (hex) as
  salt via crypto.getRandomValues. passwordHash =
  SHA-256(salt + plaintext) computed via crypto.subtle.digest.
  Salt + hash stored; plaintext never persisted. Industry-standard
  for client-side without a server (would be PBKDF2/Argon2 with
  server-side iteration count in production, but the SDK path here
  uses what\'s available in the browser without dependencies).

STORAGE
  · localStorage.cr_guest_users_v1
      { [username]: { email, salt, passwordHash, createdAt } }
  · localStorage.cr_guest_session_v1
      { username, email, expiresAt }   // 30-day TTL

SESSION
  Successful login or register sets a 30-day session, marks
  cr_stealth_auth_v1='1' (so the Start-Run gate admits the player),
  flips #profileName to the username, dismisses the boot screen.
  Boot screen auto-resumes on next load if the session is still
  valid — no re-login until expiry. window.crGuestSignOut() clears.

VALIDATION
  · Unique-username check + unique-email check before allowing register
  · Login resolves username OR email → user record → hash compare
  · Specific error messages ("Username taken", "Wrong password",
    "No account found for …") — no enumeration timing leak in this
    static build, but messages are intentionally specific because
    this is a stealth-alpha demo, not a hardened production system

A11Y / UX
  · Esc closes the modal
  · Backdrop click closes the modal
  · autocomplete=username / current-password / new-password attrs
    set correctly so password managers (1Password, Bitwarden) work
  · Tab toggle preserves entered values within the session
  · Footer reminds: "Sessions persist 30 days on this device ·
    passwords salted + SHA-256 hashed locally."

PUBLIC API
  window.crGuestOpen(initialTab)   — open the modal programmatically
  window.crGuestSession()          — read the current session
  window.crGuestSignOut()          — clear session)

